# Wi-Fi: join from the serial console (wifi-join: wpa_supplicant, udhcpc).
# SMP like the base image. The uniprocessor build broke mwifiex: the
# 88W8782's first command (0xa9) never got an answer (m1-net 68a96768,
# docs/kernel/wifi_join_test1.md), while every SMP build works. SMP rules
# out kexec here (ARM needs CPU hotplug), so loading kernels stays with the
# Ethernet loader (m1-eth, tools/eth_kernel_boot.sh).
CONFIG_PACKET=y
